==Description==
The '''XmasTree Nametag''' is an {{Color|Exclusive}} nametag which is currently unused. Based on its appearance, this is likely just a joke nametag which was never intended to be released, though the description it has does imply it was rewarded in the [[Krampus' Revenge Event]].

The '''XmasTree Nametag''' has green text with no outline. Behind it, there is a large, stretched out low quality image of a Christmas tree with a white background.

